   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I need a book for my dad. He's sixty, grumpy, and only reads about the war.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sounds like a man of focus. Does he prefer big history books, or personal stories from soldiers?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Personal stories, I think. He gets bored by maps and dates.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a memoir or a collection of letters from soldiers could be perfect. They're very human and often moving.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "He'll pretend he doesn't care, though.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's fine. Grumpy dads often read the whole thing in two days and then never mention it again.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
